" I accept the \ufffd#25\ufffdGoogle Analytics terms\ufffd/#25\ufffd"," Configure Google Analytics "," To use Google Analytics data in AdMob, you need to create a Google Analytics account and link it to your Firebase project. This link will enable data to flow between the three products. "," An account is your access point for Analytics. You can have more than one Firebase project under the same account. \ufffd#4\ufffd Learn more about accounts\ufffd/#4\ufffd"," Upon project creation, a new Google Analytics property will be created and linked to your Firebase project. This link will enable data flow between the products. Data exported from your Google Analytics property into Firebase is subject to the Firebase terms of service, while Firebase data imported into Google Analytics is subject to the Google Analytics terms of service. \ufffd#2\ufffd Learn more\ufffd/#2\ufffd. ",
" Upon project creation, a new Google Analytics property will be created in your chosen Google Analytics account and linked to your Firebase project. This link will enable data flow between the products. Data exported from your Google Analytics property into Firebase is subject to the Firebase terms of service, while Firebase data imported into Google Analytics is subject to the Google Analytics terms of service. \ufffd#2\ufffd Learn more\ufffd/#2\ufffd. "," Upon project creation, a new Google Analytics account and property will be created and linked to your Firebase project. \ufffd#2\ufffd Learn more\ufffd/#2\ufffd. ",
" A Firebase app modeled after your AdMob app will be created for linking with AdMob. \ufffd#5\ufffd Learn more\ufffd/#5\ufffd. "," These links will enable data to flow amongst the three products. Data exported from one product to another will be subject to the terms of service of the recipient product. "," A new Google Analytics account will be created and your property will be transferred to that account and linked back to your Firebase project. This link will enable data flow between the products. Note that data exported from your Google Analytics property into Firebase is subject to the Firebase terms of service, while Firebase data imported into Google Analytics is subject to the Google Analytics terms of service. \ufffd#2\ufffd Learn more\ufffd/#2\ufffd. ",
" A new Google Analytics property will be created in your chosen Google Analytics account and linked to your Firebase project.This link will enable data flow between the products. Note that data exported from your Google Analytics property into Firebase is subject to the Firebase terms of service, while Firebase data imported into Google Analytics is subject to the Google Analytics terms of service. \ufffd#2\ufffd Learn more\ufffd/#2\ufffd. "," Retry "," Retry "," Previous "," Add Firebase "," Create project ",
